/* PicoMite override of pico-sdk's script_include/default_rodata_excludes.incl
   (selected via pico_add_linker_script_override_path in CMakeLists.txt).
   Differs from the SDK fragment the same two ways as the .text rule: *libm.a:
   is NOT excluded from FLASH, and *libc.a: *lib*_a-mem*.o still are (SDK
   2.3.1 dropped those) - see default_text_excludes.incl in this directory. */
*(EXCLUDE_FILE(*libgcc.a: *libc.a: *lib*_a-mem*.o) .rodata*)
